  "name": "Servant Summon: Undine",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You gain the [Fairy] and [Cold] tags. You gain a +[SRx5] bonus to the damage roll of attacks that have the [Cold] tag.</p>\n<p>(Effect): A secondary target within a range of [Target: Single / Range: 4 Sq.] from you takes 5 direct damage.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that summons Undine, a water spirit in the form of a beautiful maiden, and uses it. Her streams and cold air freeze enemies.</p>",
